WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.207
Let’s summarize the module. Conditions produce True or False.

00:00:05.207 --> 00:00:09.642
If, elif, and else choose among paths.

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:13.607
For loops repeat over known items or counts.

00:00:13.607 --> 00:00:17.257
While loops repeat until a condition changes.

00:00:17.257 --> 00:00:21.426
Break stops a loop and continue skips a repetition.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:29.322
Together, these tools let us classify, count, flag, and summarize observations.

00:00:29.322 --> 00:00:35.593
Next, functions will help us package repeated logic into reusable pieces of code.

00:00:36.283 --> 00:00:40.990
Module 3 takes the logic you just practiced and makes it reusable.

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:49.125
Instead of rewriting the same decision or calculation in several places, you’ll learn how to package that work inside

00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:54.782
functions, pass values into them, return results, and build cleaner analytical code.
